# Customer data exports and database dumps — never commit these.
#
# The orders table holds names, email addresses, phone numbers and street
# addresses. This repo is public. A dump of it sitting untracked in the working
# tree is one `git add -A` away from being published, so the patterns below
# refuse the whole shape rather than any one filename.
#
# If you need a dump, write it outside the repo.
orders-backup-*.json
*-backup-*.json
orders-export*.csv
orders*.csv
customers*.csv
subscribers*.csv
email-list*.csv
*.dump
*.sql.gz

# Per-session agent scratch. Not project documentation — it goes stale the
# moment a session ends, and MASTER-PLAN.md is the source of truth instead.
# Scanned 2026-08-21: no secrets, no customer data.
.handoff/
